    "html": "<p>Currents flow in two wires <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> as shown in the diagram.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which combination gives the correct field direction at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> and the force on <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span>, due to the current in <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">into plane of paper, towards <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\">out of plane of paper, towards <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">into plane of paper, away from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\">out of plane of paper, away from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span></li></ol>"
